content.text:
Now landscape overrides. Current block:

```
@media (max-height: 500px) and (orientation: landscape) {
  :root { --header-h: 54px; }
  .hud {...}
  .team-card {...}
  .team-name { display: block; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .07em; }
  ...
  .controls {...}
  .active-profile { position: static; width: auto; padding: 5px 7px; }
  ...
  .action-stack { grid-row: auto; order: 0; padding-left: 0; flex-direction: row; ...}
  ...
  .hotbar-wrap { grid-row: auto; order: 0; width: auto; }
```

Need:
- `.tn-full { display:inline } .tn-short { display:none }`
- `.active-profile { grid-column:auto; max-width: 260px; justify-self:start; }`
- `.action-stack { grid-column:auto; }`
- `.hotbar-wrap { grid-column:auto; }`

Also mobile `.team-name` short display block; landscape overrides. Add tn rules after `.team-name`.

Also `.team-topline` justify space-between already.

Let's edit.

input.oldString:
.team-name { display: block; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .07em; }
.team-topline { justify-content: space-between; }
.team-b .team-topline { justify-content: space-between; }

input.newString:
.team-name { display: block; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .07em; }
.tn-full { display: inline; }
.tn-short { display: none; }
.team-topline { justify-content: space-between; }
.team-b .team-topline { justify-content: space-between; }

